+## Request 18: Late fees
+**Status**: ✅ Completed and tested
+
+### What was done
+- Added `lateFee(invoice, asOf)` to src/reports.js
+- Calculates 0.04% of amount due per day overdue
+- Formula: (amount due) * 0.04 * (days overdue) / 100
+- Returns 0 if invoice not overdue or not in 'issued'/'partially_paid' status
+- Returns 0 for draft or paid invoices
+- Uses balanceDue for amount calculations (accounts for payments)
+- Uses daysBetween for overdue day calculations
+- Uses roundCents for proper rounding
+- Added 10 comprehensive tests covering:
+  - 0 fee for draft/paid invoices
+  - 0 fee for not-yet-due invoices
+  - 0 fee when due date equals asOf
+  - Correct fee calculation (0.04% per day)
+  - Fee accumulation over multiple days
+  - Fee based on balance due (after payments), not total
+  - Works for partially_paid invoices
+  - Null/undefined invoice handling
+  - Large overdue periods
